    terms: {
      title:'Using this website.', intro:'What the site offers, what is still being planned, and how to use our contact channels respectfully.', contents:'On this page',
      sections:[
        ['About the website','The organizing team operates this website to introduce Piano Club at UC San Diego and help people enquire about the proposed club. It is an independent student initiative, not an official university website. The club is still being formed and has not yet been approved.'],
        ['Plans, access and participation','Programs described as planned or proposed are not confirmed services. Dates, rooms, eligibility and participation arrangements depend on the necessary approvals and resources. Check the relevant program or event information before making arrangements.','An email enquiry or expression of interest is not a membership confirmation, an event registration, a room booking or permission to use university facilities. A suggested email template is optional and can be changed or removed by its sender.'],
        ['Respectful contact','Use the public address for genuine questions, ideas and matters related to the club. Respect other people’s privacy and avoid sending material you are not entitled to share. Spam, threats, harassment, impersonation and abusive messages may be filtered or left unanswered.'],
        ['Content, names and images','Names, logos, images, compositions and other materials may be protected by rights belonging to their respective holders. Their appearance here does not give visitors permission to reproduce or commercially use them, and does not imply university or third-party endorsement.','Contact the organizers if you believe material on the website affects your rights. The website’s notices do not replace any permission required to use a name, mark, work or image.'],
        ['External opportunities and website availability','Links to competitions, performances and other external resources are provided for information. Their organizers set their own eligibility, fees, deadlines and rules. Check the original source before relying on an opportunity.','Website information may change as plans develop, and errors or interruptions may occur. You can report an error through the Contact page. These statements do not exclude responsibilities that cannot lawfully be excluded.'],
        ['Future services and questions','Any future paid tutoring, competition, recording or other activity needing separate participation, payment or consent terms will require those details before it starts. This website does not currently accept payments or provide a booking system.','For questions about these terms, contact hello@tritonpiano.org. The date above identifies the latest update.']
      ]
    }
